{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113610","id":3074267815,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc63PZqn","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113610","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113610.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113610.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113610","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113610/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113610/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113610/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5e81ec4b122038f185842fa0ac8a9893119e022d","number":113610,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix export warning remaining visible after deleting last export preset","user":{"login":"aminalav","id":182843516,"node_id":"U_kgDOCuX4fA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182843516?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminalav","html_url":"https://github.com/aminalav","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminalav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminalav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminalav/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminalav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminalav/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminalav/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminalav/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminalav/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aminalav/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nSummary:\r\nWhen deleting the last export preset in the Project Export dialog, the warning bar at the bottom remains visible even though no preset is selected.\r\n\r\nWhat the Cause is:\r\nIt appears that the __edit_preset() function hides all preset dependent error labels when there is no valid preset index, but does not hid export_warning. This would explain why the previous warning text remains visible.\r\n\r\nFix:\r\nThe fix is to hide export_warning when p_index is invalid.\r\n\r\nFor testing steps, create an export preset that triggers a warning. Delete the preset, and the warning bar should now correctly disappear.\r\n\r\nThis fixes #113428","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slat